{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T17:32:24.253Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1781","claim:pm-gh1787","claim:pm-glmcnd","claim:pm-jzrtsr","lineage:pm-gh1787","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1781+pm-gh1787+pm-glmcnd+pm-jzrtsr","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1781","claim:pm-gh1787","claim:pm-glmcnd","claim:pm-jzrtsr","lineage:pm-gh1787","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/5","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-26T17:32:24.253Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Greptile on cf60e0226 (P2, confirmed against main, fixed): a Python prefixed string holding an escaped apostrophe before a dict member with a bare reference on the same line became a finding, because the shell reading closed the bytes string at the escaped apostrophe and declined its real closing quote. When a single-quoted string closes at an apostrophe a backslash precedes and only word characters follow it up to the next apostrophe, that apostrophe is the string's closing quote under Python's reading and declines nothing; a shell segment opened after a blank (the round-3 fixture) is still declined. Only single-quoted closes lend that reading. Spec cases added; the corpus differential is unchanged."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T17:32:24.253Z"}],"before_hash":"09909eb4a3fd76c71b1ca1b02ff6863d4d3d6e263a916883257175d202b4bcc8","after_hash":"a5171dd4903f12505ce6bbc642cab3ce0fa139d979463970e485e6e37dc379c0","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"fbcb4cd5d6dcc2e4edfe456837a21b900304b9d9560c50d69e92469573863dd0"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T17:34:11.859Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"bde5973a64851be416b1c911","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1781","claim:pm-gh1787","claim:pm-glmcnd","claim:pm-jzrtsr","lineage:pm-gh1787","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1781+pm-gh1787+pm-glmcnd+pm-jzrtsr","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1781","claim:pm-gh1787","claim:pm-glmcnd","claim:pm-jzrtsr","lineage:pm-gh1787","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.332","source":"probe"}},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes/6","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-26T17:34:11.858Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 5 on PR #1789 (Git ceilings, release retries and POSIX quoting reported clean): (1) fixed: a Python-prefixed string inside a container now judges its escapes by the context before the prefix, so a raw string holding an escaped apostrophe in a dict no longer shifts the later member's boundary. (2) deferred to pm-ghgf4a, both false positives with no lost finding: distrust after a declined quote is line-wide, so a prose apostrophe in a YAML flow scalar or a joined shell segment disables later boundaries of that kind; and the shell-word reading joins Python adjacent literals without decoding a hex escape between them."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T17:34:11.859Z"}],"before_hash":"a5171dd4903f12505ce6bbc642cab3ce0fa139d979463970e485e6e37dc379c0","after_hash":"61e24d14f0d4299c129527997e1321d880675eab86a54d402a1a1db61b3b27e0","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e6eeb3c5402b8b6b462eb2a2304edb6660b1aa2d3dd0698f9fa0fb667c4de732"}
